    "title": "Person dies after being hit by vehicle in west Charlotte - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WSOCTV.com News Staff ,\n2 hours ago A person died after being hit by a car in west Charlotte Wednesday night.\nIt happened just before 8:45 p.m. on the 2100 block of Beatties Ford Road.\nALSO READ: Elderly woman struck, killed by vehicle outside Cleveland County fair\nAccording to MEDIC, the person was taken to an area hospital with life-threatening injuries.\nThe Charlotte Mecklenburg Police Department later confirmed that the person died.\nNo additional details have been made available.\nThis is a developing story. Check back with wsoctv.com for updates.",
